-----------------------------------------------------------------------
CHANGING THE TEST
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

  Change a define in the deck, then the matching key in
  poisson_3d_letters.cases (the deck row fails until both agree). To
  run the user's full resolution, set H_REFINE_SIZE and H_FLOOR to
  0.08 in both (about an hour on the old build).
